WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.632
Once the model returns jay son, parse it and validate the values.

00:00:04.632 --> 00:00:13.167
The code first checks that the category belongs to the allowed category set and that urgency belongs to the allowed

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:16.252
urgency set. This is an important software boundary.

00:00:16.252 --> 00:00:22.102
Asking for jay son is not the same thing as receiving trustworthy application data.

00:00:22.102 --> 00:00:24.806
Parse first, validate second.
